upstream-build-fixes.patch - 2026-08-12

Temporary build fixes for diegosouzapw/OmniRoute release/v3.8.50 (tip 7ca7369),
whose default branch currently does not compile (upstream issue #9985; upstream's
own Docker publish fails on every run).

Contents: upstream PR #10131 "fix(quality): green release/v3.8.50 base-reds
round 2 (#9985)" applied VERBATIM. It repairs the merge-storm corruption that
broke the build: the unclosed regolo entry in gateways.ts, the missing brace in
modelSelectModalHelpers.ts, the duplicate handleFalVideoGeneration import, the
wrong conol-web/deepai import depths, the tinycmsSigner wasm URL fallback that
Turbopack cannot resolve, the stale catalog.ts re-exports, the duplicate
migration 143_job_registry.sql, plus type/test/ratchet fixes that do not affect
the image but ride along verbatim.

Remove this file and the "Apply upstream build fixes" workflow step once upstream
merges their fixes (PR #10131 or the smaller #10108/#10102/#10094/#10140). The
workflow step warns and continues when this patch stops applying cleanly.

